==> [1/6] Replication access on the primary (hba line at the TOP, only once)
==> [2/6] Fresh base backup into /var/lib/postgresql/16/replica
==> [3/6] Replica config (Ubuntu keeps config in /etc, so write our own)

==> [4/6] Who is who
primary port 5432  pg_is_in_recovery = f
replica port 5433  pg_is_in_recovery = t

